[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Faster Than Sound!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.50]How fast did the winning car go? | 获胜的汽车速度有多快？
[00:15.46]Once a year, a race is held for old cars. | 每年举行一次旧汽车比赛。
[00:20.93]A lot of cars entered for this race last year and there was a great deal of excitement just before it began. | 去年很多汽车参加了这项比赛，比赛开始之前，人们异常激动。
[00:30.67]One of the most handsome cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost. | 最漂亮的汽车之一是一辆劳斯莱斯“银魂”。
[00:36.65]The most unusual car was a Benz which had only three wheels. | 最不寻常的汽车是一辆只有3个轮子的奔驰。
[00:43.42]Built in 1885, it was the oldest car taking part. | 这辆车造于1885年，是参赛车中最老的一辆。
[00:50.17]After a great many loud explosions, the race began. | 在一阵阵震耳欲聋的爆炸声之后，比赛开始了。
[00:56.11]Many of the cars broke down on the course and some drivers spent more time under their cars than in them! | 很多汽车在途中抛了锚，有些驾驶员花在车底下的时间比坐在车里的时间还长！
[01:05.86]A few cars, however, completed the race. | 然而有几辆车跑完了全程。
[01:09.70]The winning car reached a speed of forty miles an hour -- much faster than any of its rivals. | 获胜的那辆车时速达到40英里——远远超过任何对手。
[01:18.47]It sped downhill at the end of the race and its driver had a lot of trouble trying to stop it. | 比赛结束时它在下山时飞驰，驾驶员费了好大劲才把它停住。
[01:26.04]The race gave everyone a great deal of pleasure. | 这场比赛给了每个人极大的乐趣。
[01:30.19]It was very different from modern car races but no less exciting. | 它与现代汽车比赛大不相同，但激动人心的程度毫不逊色。
